            "n(S) = 6\n\n"

            "⦿ (b) Find the probability of obtaining a multiple of 2:\n"
            "⦁ The multiples of 2 are:\n"
            "M = {2, 4, 6}\n"
            "n(M) = 3\n\n"
        r"P(M)=\frac{n(M)}{n(S)}"
        "\n"
        r"P(M)=\frac{3}{6}=\frac{1}{2}"
        "\n\n"

            "⦿ (c) Find the probability of obtaining a prime number:\n"
            "⦁ The prime numbers are:\n"
            "N = {2, 3, 5}\n"
            "n(N) = 3\n\n"
        r"P(N)=\frac{n(N)}{n(S)}"
        "\n"
        r"P(N)=\frac{3}{6}=\frac{1}{2}"
        "\n\n"

