        answer: "⦿ Photosynthesis:\n\n"
            "• Photosynthesis is the process by which green plants use sunlight, water and carbon dioxide to manufacture food in the form of glucose and release oxygen as a by-product.",
        explanation: "",
      ),
      PracticeQuestion(
