            "(b) Give four reasons why death rites are performed.\n"
            "(BECE 2011 Q2)",
        answer: "Correct Answer: (a) Answer:\n"
            "⦿ Old age.\n"
            "⦿ Sickness/diseases (e.g., malaria, accidents, etc.).\n"
            "⦿ Natural disasters (e.g., earthquakes, floods).\n"
            "⦿ Murder or war.\n\n"
