            "⦿ Professional Occupation — It is the structured job or trade a person holds to secure their financial livelihood.\n\n"
            "Answer: (b)\n"
            "⦿ Domestic Duties — Daily internal home maintenance tasks like sweeping, washing, and tidying rooms.\n"
            "⦿ School Assignments — Academic responsibilities like studying lessons, taking quizzes, and writing class research papers.\n"
            "⦿ Community Projects — Joint public construction and cleaning tasks like building local schools, fixing roads, or clearing shared infrastructure.\n\n"
            "Answer: (c)\n"
            "⦿ Funds basic survival needs — Earning salaries from professions like teaching or nursing provides the financial means to purchase food, housing, and clothing.\n"
            "⦿ Lowers dependency rates — Maximizing employment across a town ensures that individuals can provide for themselves, reducing dependency on others and curbing social vices like theft.\n"
