            "⦿ Boosts national economic productivity — Active labor in agricultural and industrial sectors increases the supply of essential products, raising the standard of living.\n"
            "⦿ Builds personal respect and image — Excelling in an honorable trade fosters self-esteem and can position an individual as a positive role model in their community.\n"
            "⦿ Sharpens technical knowledge and skills — Consistent practice within an occupation allows workers to expand their expertise and operational capacities.",
