            "⦿ Undermines the rule of law — Deceptive practices weaken legal frameworks, creating an unfair business environment and higher operational costs.\n"
            "⦿ Widens the wealth gap — Cheating enables a small group to hoard shared economic resources, deeping poverty for the broader community.\n"
            "⦿ Triggers social conflict — Discovering dishonest activities can spark deep misunderstandings, fuel neighborhood crime, and break trust.",
