      PracticeQuestion(
        scenario: "Question 15: State four benefits of time management to students.\n"
            "(BECE 2022 Q8a)",
        answer: "Correct Answer:\n"
            "⦿ Accomplish major goals with less effort — Planning daily tasks according to a set schedule helps students maximize their learning potential and boost exam scores with lower stress.\n"
            "⦿ Drives logical, calculated decision-making — Dedicating sufficient blocks of time to review options prevents hasty choices, resulting in better personal and academic directions.\n"
            "⦿ Sharpens concentration and life focus — Managing time effectively ensures that open hours are used wisely, helping students avoid distractions during tests, lectures, or group projects.\n"
            "⦿ Enforces appropriate task prioritization — Organizing activities by importance prompts students to tackle urgent assignments first, deferring minor tasks for later.\n"
            "⦿ Reduces academic anxiety and stress — Meeting project deadlines ahead of time minimizes the intense pressure that can make schoolwork overwhelming.\n"
            "⦿ Prevents chronic procrastination — Sticking to a structured timeline leaves no room for delaying assignments or putting off studies.\n"
            "⦿ Boosts school productivity — Making efficient use of school hours minimizes chronic lateness and absenteeism, helping students perform at their best.\n"
            "⦿ Builds strong personal discipline — Following institutional schedules helps students develop structured, orderly habits that curb laziness.\n"
            "⦿ Eliminates harmful idleness — Keeping busy with planned academic or recreational tasks helps students avoid stagnation and remain productive.\n"
            "⦿ Improves work quality — Managing time well gives students the opportunity to double-check their essays, lab projects, and exam answers without rushing.\n"
            "⦿ Builds academic self-confidence — Facing school challenges with organized preparation helps students complete their assignments with greater assurance.",
        explanation: ".",
