      PracticeQuestion(
        scenario: "Question 1: Describe how Wudu (Ablution) in Islam is performed.\n"
            "(BECE 2002 Q1b)",
        answer: "Correct Answer:\n"
            "⦿ Get clean water and say 'Bismillah' in the name of Allah.\n"
            "⦿ State the Niyyah in the heart that the act is for the purpose of worship and purity.\n"
            "⦿ Wash each hand to the wrist three times starting from the right hand.\n"
            "⦿ Wash your mouth three times thoroughly.\n"
            "⦿ Clean your nostrils three times by inhaling and expelling water.\n"
            "⦿ Wash your face three times from the forehead to the chin and from the right ear to the left ear.\n"
            "⦿ Wash the forearm to the elbow three times, starting with the right arm first then the left arm.\n"
            "⦿ Wipe the head from the forehead backward to the neck then back to the forehead.\n"
            "⦿ Use the index fingers and the thumbs to clean the ears inside and out.\n"
            "⦿ Wash your feet three times up to the ankles, starting with the right then the left.",
