            "⦿ Seeking professional guidance: Actively utilizing counseling services from reliable authorities when facing stress or social challenges.\n"
            "⦿ Practising moral values: Implementing the ethical and clean living instructions taught within one's religious faith.\n"
            "⦿ Avoiding suspicious settings: Declining food, drinks, or gifts offered by suspicious individuals, known users, or bad peers.\n"
            "⦿ Effective time planning: Drafting a functional personal timetable for daily studies and maintaining structural discipline.\n"
            "⦿ Prioritising medical approval: Consulting a certified doctor before taking any health remedies to avoid self-medication bottlenecks.",
        explanation: ".",
