      PracticeQuestion(
        scenario: "Question 5: (a) State four ways of dressing decently.\n"
            "(b) Explain four reasons why an individual needs to dress decently.\n"
            "(BECE 2017 Q5)",
        answer: "Correct Answer: (a) Answer:\n"
            "⦿ Neat maintenance: Ensuring that clothing is washed clean, free from spots, and neatly ironed before wearing.\n"
            "⦿ Strategic body coverage: Picking clothes that appropriately cover all private and sensitive portions of the human body.\n"
            "⦿ Polished footwear choices: Ensuring that shoes are properly cleaned and well-polished before stepping out.\n"
            "⦿ Decent hair grooming: Keeping head hair clean, combed, and regularly trimmed to avoid a bushy, unkempt appearance.\n"
            "⦿ Tidy shirt styling: Fastening all shirt buttons correctly and neatly tucking the shirt tails inside the trousers or skirt.\n"
            "⦿ Appropriate accessory usage: Utilizing a functional leather belt or trouser braces appropriately to secure the waistline, without ever combining both accessories simultaneously.\n"
            "⦿ Harmonious color matching: Matching the specific color of your waist belt with the color tone of your footwear for a balanced appearance.\n"
            "⦿ Preserving garment structure: Leaving long-sleeved formal shirts unfolded down to the wrist rather than choosing to roll them up untidily.\n"
            "⦿ Avoiding revealing fabrics: Selecting opaque materials instead of transparent or see-through clothes that reveal undergarments.\n"
            "⦿ Wearing undamaged fabrics: Discarding or repairing torn, frayed, or shredded clothing items.\n"
            "⦿ Managing personal body odors: Using gentle deodorants, limes, or clean body sprays to preserve a pleasant personal scent.\n"
            "⦿ Avoiding body-hugging designs: Ensuring that young women select comfortable, non-seductive designs instead of extremely skin-tight dresses.\n"
            "⦿ Proper footwear accessories: Ensuring that shoes are worn with matching socks.\n"
            "⦿ Sizing undergarments properly: Selecting clean undergarments that stay fully hidden and are shorter than the main outer dress.\n\n"
            "Answer: (b)\n"
            "⦿ It mirrors your personal background: Your chosen clothing instantly acts as a direct sign of your internal character and moral values.\n"
            "⦿ It prevents negative visual attention: It acts as a safety shield, avoiding unwanted looks, bad remarks, or safety risks from predators.\n"
            "⦿ It highlights personal accountability: It presents you as an admirable, well-organized, and dependable individual in professional settings.\n"
