            "(b) Explain any four reasons for which substance abuse should be avoided.\n"
            "(BECE 2020 Q6)",
        answer: "Correct Answer: (a) Answer:\n"
            "⦿ Loss of life: Drug abuse triggers fatal medical issues like cardiac arrest, stroke, or cancer, directly leading to an early death.\n"
            "⦿ Decreased economic output: The cognitive and mental disruptions caused by addiction reduce performance, leading to work errors and chronic absenteeism.\n"
            "⦿ Descent into social vices: Addicts frequently turn to illegal survival behaviors like armed robbery, retail theft, prostitution, or physical assaults.\n"
